{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的感受词和音乐提示在部分屏幕上过密，视线需要频繁切换；Y 稳定的左右分栏更容易快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点词加亮，让人即使边听边扫，也能迅速抓住每一段心理变化的核心；同时，它更完整地呈现了从害怕添负担、发现彼此需要、渴望靠近，到害怕失去、最终接受不确定的心理推进。X 的音乐感受也更细，尤其是按音乐进程出现的提示，能让人感受到情绪如何在乐句中转折，而不只是知道人物此刻高兴或难过。Y 更顺口、更清爽，但部分心理转折和音乐细节被概括掉了，整体的层次与细腻程度不如 X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "61d5ab59-a24f-401c-9261-665170d87adf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T060836866038Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:09:58.823007+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "08e32e3643a50b096e1896285d5b09eb5d8eb7642a15afbc54676419907a6f58", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt